[
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:0.1"], "en": "The Therāpadāna:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:0.2"], "en": "Kaccāyanavagga 2.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:0.3"], "en": "The Apadāna of the Elder Vakkali", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:1.1", "PA_tha-ap_534:1.2"], "en": "“In this hundred-thousandth aeon, a Leader appeared;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:1.3"], "en": "he was of matchless name and immeasurable.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:1.4"], "en": "By name he was Padumuttara.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:2.1"], "en": "His face had the appearance of a lotus,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:2.2"], "en": "and his skin was as pure and bright as a lotus.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:2.3"], "en": "Unstained by the world,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:2.4"], "en": "like a lotus by water—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:3.1"], "en": "the Hero whose eyes are like lotus petals.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:3.2"], "en": "Like a lotus beloved by Kanta,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:3.3"], "en": "and possessing the fragrance of a lotus,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:3.4"], "en": "therefore he is named Padumuttara.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:4.1"], "en": "The eldest in the world, free from conceit,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:4.2"], "en": "like eyes for the blind;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:4.3"], "en": "one of peaceful appearance, a treasure-house of virtues.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:4.4"], "en": "The ocean of compassionate wisdom,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:5.1", "PA_tha-ap_534:5.2"], "en": "that Great Hero, at one time honored by Brahmās, asuras, and gods;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:5.3", "PA_tha-ap_534:5.4"], "en": "In the midst of the assembly of people, crowded with gods and humans,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:6.1"], "en": "the Supreme Victor spoke with his fragrant mouth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:6.2"], "en": "And with his sweet song,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:6.3"], "en": "delighting the entire assembly,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:6.4"], "en": "he conversed with his own disciple.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:7.1"], "en": "One resolved in faith, wise,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:7.2"], "en": "and longing for a vision of me—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:7.3"], "en": "there is no other such as this.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:7.4"], "en": "Just as this monk Vakkali was;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:8.1", "PA_tha-ap_534:8.2"], "en": "at that time, I was born into a brahmin family in the city of Haṃsavatī.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:8.3"], "en": "Having heard that speech and having sacrificed,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:8.4", "PA_tha-ap_534:9.1"], "en": "I took delight in that place and in that stainless one together with his disciples.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:9.2", "PA_tha-ap_534:9.3"], "en": "Having invited the Tathāgata and fed him for seven days,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:9.4"], "en": "I then clothed him in fine garments.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:10.1"], "en": "Bowing my head to him,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:10.2"], "en": "who is an ocean of infinite virtues,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:10.3"], "en": "I am submerged in him, filled with joy.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:10.4"], "en": "I spoke these words:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:11.1", "PA_tha-ap_534:11.2"], "en": "“The sage whom you have befriended, seven [lives] from now;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:11.3"], "en": "\"The bhikkhu who possesses faith is the foremost;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:11.4"], "en": "may I become such as he, O Sage!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:12.1"], "en": "When this was said, the Great Hero—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:12.2"], "en": "With unobstructed vision,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:12.3", "PA_tha-ap_534:12.4"], "en": "the Great Sage uttered these words to the assembly.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:13.1"], "en": "“Behold this young brahmin,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:13.2"], "en": "wearing a bright yellow lower garment,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:13.3"], "en": "his limbs adorned with golden ornaments.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:13.4"], "en": "Charming to the eyes of people.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:14.1", "PA_tha-ap_534:14.2"], "en": "This [prediction] concerns the future time of the Great Sage Gotama;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:14.3"], "en": "He will be the foremost among those resolved through faith;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:14.4"], "en": "he will become a disciple,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:15.1"], "en": "whether born as a deva or a human.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:15.2"], "en": "Free from all burning fevers,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:15.3"], "en": "enriched with all enjoyments,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:15.4"], "en": "he will transmigrate in happiness.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:16.1"], "en": "In a hundred thousand aeons hence,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:16.2"], "en": "one born of the Okkāka clan,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:16.3"], "en": "known by the family name Gotama, will appear.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:16.4"], "en": "A Teacher shall appear in the world.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:17.1"], "en": "His heir in the Dhammas,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:17.2"], "en": "his own legitimate son, fashioned from the Dhamma;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:17.3", "PA_tha-ap_534:17.4"], "en": "\"One named Vakkali shall become a disciple of the Teacher.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:18.1"], "en": "By that distinguished deed,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:18.2"], "en": "And through my volition and aspiration,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:18.3"], "en": "having cast off this human body,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:18.4"], "en": "I went to the realm of the Thirty-three.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:19.1", "PA_tha-ap_534:19.2"], "en": "Having been happy in every place as he wandered through various states of existence,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:19.3"], "en": "he was born in the city of Sāvatthī.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:19.4"], "en": "I was born into a certain family.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:20.1"], "en": "I was not raised in luxury,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:20.2"], "en": "yet I was as tender as a newly sprouted leaf.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:20.3"], "en": "Terrified by the fear of a malevolent spirit,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:20.4", "PA_tha-ap_534:21.1"], "en": "she lay prostrate at the feet of the Great Sage.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:21.2"], "en": "With dejected minds at evening, they said:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:21.3"], "en": "\"We give this to you, O Lord;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:21.4"], "en": "be our refuge, O Leader.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:22.1", "PA_tha-ap_534:22.2"], "en": "Then the Sage, the refuge for those who fear,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:22.3"], "en": "accepted me with his webbed hand marked by the wheel.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:22.4"], "en": "With his soft and tender hand.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:23.1"], "en": "From that time forth,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:23.2"], "en": "I have been protected by him through that which was not to be guarded.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:23.3", "PA_tha-ap_534:23.4"], "en": "Freed from all bonds and grown great through happiness,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:24.1"], "en": "he has become separated from the Sugata.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:24.2"], "en": "I feel a moment of longing;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:24.3"], "en": "though I am but seven years from birth,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:24.4"], "en": "I have gone forth into homelessness.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:25.1", "PA_tha-ap_534:25.2"], "en": "The supreme form, born of all perfections, with dark-blue eyes,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:25.3"], "en": "adorned with every beauty.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:25.4"], "en": "\"I was dwelling unsatisfied.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:26.1"], "en": "Knowing my delight in the form of the Buddha,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:26.2"], "en": "the Victor then exhorted me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:26.3", "PA_tha-ap_534:26.4"], "en": "\"Enough, Vakkali! Why do you delight in form, which brings joy only to fools?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:27.1"], "en": "For he who sees the True Dharma,\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:27.2"], "en": "The wise one sees me;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:27.3"], "en": "not seeing the true Dharma,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:27.4"], "en": "even while seeing me, he does not see me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:28.1"], "en": "The body has endless disadvantages,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:28.2"], "en": "resembling a poisonous tree;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:28.3"], "en": "it is the dwelling place of all diseases.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:28.4"], "en": "A mere mass of suffering.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:29.1", "PA_tha-ap_534:29.2"], "en": "Having become disenchanted with form, [one should contemplate] the arising and passing away of the aggregates.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:29.3"], "en": "“Behold the defilements;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:29.4"], "en": "you shall go to their end with ease.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:30.1"], "en": "Thus was I instructed by him.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:30.2"], "en": "Desiring the welfare of others,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:30.3", "PA_tha-ap_534:30.4"], "en": "the Leader ascended Gijjhakūṭa and meditated in a mountain cave.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:31.1", "PA_tha-ap_534:31.2"], "en": "Standing at the foot of the mountain, the Great Sage comforted him;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:31.3"], "en": "the Victor spoke these words: \"Vakkali!\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:31.4", "PA_tha-ap_534:32.1", "PA_tha-ap_534:32.2"], "en": "Having heard that, I was filled with joy and leapt upon a rocky mountain slope many hundreds of fathoms high.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:32.3"], "en": "Then, by the power of the Buddha,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:32.4"], "en": "he went to the earth as if in ease;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:33.1"], "en": "once more he taught the Dhamma.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:33.2"], "en": "The arising and passing away of the aggregates;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:33.3"], "en": "having understood that Dhamma,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:33.4"], "en": "I attained arahantship.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:34.1"], "en": "Then, in the midst of that great assembly,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:34.2", "PA_tha-ap_534:34.3"], "en": "the One Who Has Reached the End of the Path declared me to be the foremost among those resolved through faith.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:34.4"], "en": "Mahāmati proclaimed:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:35.1"], "en": "\"In the hundred-thousandth aeon,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:35.2"], "en": "that deed which I performed then— \"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:35.3"], "en": "I do not know a miserable rebirth;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:35.4"], "en": "this is the fruit of worshipping the Buddha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:36.1"], "en": "My defilements have been incinerated.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:36.2"], "en": "...pe...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:36.3"], "en": "I dwell free from taints.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:37.1"], "en": "Welcome indeed has come to me!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:37.2"], "en": "...pe...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:37.3"], "en": "the Buddha’s teaching has been accomplished.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:38.1"], "en": "The four analytical knowledges (paṭisambhidā) [are attained].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:38.2"], "en": "\"...pe...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:38.3"], "en": "the Buddha's teaching has been accomplished.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:39.1"], "en": "Thus indeed did the Venerable Elder Vakkali speak these verses.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_534:40.1"], "en": "The legend of the Elder Vakkali is the second.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"}
